# NOTE: this file ships to every project that clones the template, so it must be
# correct for DOWNSTREAM use — where session summaries and guides are meant to be
# committed. That's the whole point of keeping records. Only genuinely transient or
# machine-local things belong here.

# --- Transient by design -------------------------------------------------
# Plan-mode working artifacts. Disposable once the work lands; the durable
# version graduates to docs/ as a guide.
plans/*
!plans/README.md

tmp/*
!tmp/README.md

# --- Machine-local -------------------------------------------------------
# Resolved paths, tokens, per-developer permissions.
settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Editor / OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- This repo's own working area (not part of the shipped template) -----
# Planning notes for building claude-template itself. Reference the private
# source and must never be published.
implementation-files/
